## 27. Evaluation Checklist

Before finishing evaluation, check:

```text
I evaluated every success criterion.
I used testing evidence for each judgement.
I included client/user feedback if possible.
I clearly marked achieved/partly achieved/not achieved.
I explained product strengths.
I explained specific limitations.
I suggested realistic future improvements.
I reflected on important design/development changes.
I explained whether the original problem was solved.
I avoided vague statements such as "it works well".
```

